<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23955" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλε-αρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖλαρ</span></b>  (q.v.); 
			Ep.
		 gen. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελείατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Numen.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.305a
			</span></i>; dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελέασσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.437
				</span></i>
			: 
				contr.
			 in dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλητι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			; neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλητα</span> cj. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.10
			</span></i>:—<i>bait,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.21.6
			</span></i> (pl.): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινος</span>
			<i>bait</i> for a person, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				264
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				981.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				25
			</span></i> (pl.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαὶ γάρ, ἆθλα, δ. ἂ ὁ θεὸς
					ἔδωκεν ἀνθρώποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho Soph.
					49
				</span></i>
			: c. gen. rei, <i>an incitement to</i> . ., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὴ κακοῦ δέλεαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					69d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				2.39
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. σοφίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					880.6
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyzicus</span>).</div>
